ntment?","CHIME_TEXT13":"Do you confirm to ascend this Chime?","CHIME_TEXT14":"Unlockable","CHIME_TEXT15":"Please select the shard(s) you want to Disassemble","CHIME_TEXT16":"Owned Chime Shards","CHIME_TEXT17":"Transfer","CHIME_TEXT18":"Only Spare Shards can be used for the transfer"}}